WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Open Profile Manager: an 85-second tutorial.

00:05.000 --> 00:09.467
Install by building from source.

00:09.467 --> 00:16.467
Clone the repository, run the local installer, and confirm the installed version.

00:16.467 --> 00:21.233
Add profiles and keep their state separate.

00:21.233 --> 00:29.233
Work, Research, and Client profiles are added with distinct Codex homes, then listed.

00:29.233 --> 00:33.800
Log in through the official Codex flow.

00:33.800 --> 00:39.800
The Work profile delegates login to Codex. OPM never touches authentication tokens.

00:39.800 --> 00:44.633
Check quota as status information, never as an automatic rotation signal.

00:44.633 --> 00:51.633
Read-only usage is shown for all three profiles.

00:51.633 --> 00:56.500
Pick a profile and launch it explicitly.

00:56.500 --> 00:65.500
Launch the CLI, official app, or a profile-specific Finder launcher.

00:65.500 --> 00:70.500
Run the health check to see what is ready.

00:70.500 --> 00:78.000
The registry, Codex CLI, official app, and private profile directories all pass.

00:78.000 --> 00:85.000
Open Profile Manager: explicit profiles, read-only status, native app, and Finder launchers.
